# S1 — sync & atomics. Campaign 1, frozen 2026-07-24 in
# investigations/2026-07-24-whatif-campaign-thresholds.md §4.
#
# Bounds are O(1) throughout on purpose: a var-free bound always substitutes at
# the call site, so it MAXIMIZES propagation and measures the true ceiling.
# None of these is asserted to be truthful — that is the probe's question, not
# the sweep's. (*sync.Pool).Get in particular calls p.New on an empty pool,
# which is arbitrary user code; prediction 5 says this is what sinks the set.
(*sync.Pool).Get O(1)
(*sync.Pool).Put O(1)
(*sync/atomic.Bool).Load O(1)
(*sync.Once).Do O(1)
